isery."},{"w":"acedia","lang":"Greek, via Latin","family":"low","meaning":"Listlessness of the spirit; not caring about anything."},{"w":"liberosis","lang":"coined by John Koenig","family":"low","meaning":"The wish to care less about things."},{"w":"torschlusspanik","lang":"German","family":"tense","meaning":"Fear that time is running out on your chances."},{"w":"vergüenza ajena","lang":"Spanish","family":"tense","meaning":"Embarrassment felt on someone else’s behalf."},{"w":"angst","lang":"German","family":"tense","meaning":"Deep, general anxiety about life."},{"w":"limerence","lang":"English","family":"tense","meaning":"Obsessive longing for someone to love you back."},{"w":"schadenfreude","lang":"German","family":"heated","meaning":"Pleasure at someone else’s misfortune."},{"w":"hangry","lang":"English","family":"heated","meaning":"Angry because you’re hungry."}],"blends":[{"name":"Bittersweet","a":"bright","b":"low","meaning":"Glad and sad about the same thing."},{"name":"Nervous excitement","a":"bright","b":"tense","meaning":"Excited and scared at once, before something big."},{"name":"Cautious hope","a":"bright","b":"tense","meaning":"Hoping, while bracing for a letdown."},{"name":"Thrilled fear","a":"curious","b":"tense","meaning":"Wonder with a jolt of danger, like a big drop or a storm at sea."},{"name":"Proud of someone","a":"proud","b":"warm","meaning":"Their win feels like yours."},{"name":"Nostalgic joy","a":"warm","b":"wistful","meaning":"Happy to remember, a little sad it’s past."},{"name":"Melancholy calm","a":"calm","b":"wistful","meaning":"Quietly sad, and at peace with it."},{"name":"Relief after sadness","a":"calm","b":"low","meaning":"Glad it’s over; sad about how it went."},{"name":"Happy-tired","a":"bright","b":"low","meaning":"Worn out from something good."},{"name":"Guilty pleasure","a":"bright","b":"low","meaning":"Enjoying it, a little ashamed."},{"name":"Hurt anger","a":"low","b":"heated","meaning":"Angry because it hurt."},{"name":"Lovin